# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets
#
# .env holds the TigerGraph REST++ SECRET and TFGNN_PII_SALT. The salt is
# the one that bites twice: it is not just a credential, it is the key the
# Device / IP_Address / Email / Phone / Address / Identity_Document primary
# ids are derived from, so leaking it makes every tokenised id in the
# graph reversible by dictionary search.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent and tool configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
.codex/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated knowledge graph. Rebuilt from source by `graphify update .`,
# and it keeps dated snapshot directories, so tracking it turns every
# code change into a large unrelated diff.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
graphify-out/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime load artifacts: PSV shards, export manifest, verification
# reports, pipeline logs. Runtime-specific and large --- the transaction
# dataset alone runs to several GB at corpus scale.
#
# EXPORT_DIR is configurable, so the bare *.psv rule is the backstop for
# an export written outside artifacts/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
artifacts/
*.psv
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
